nt-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">IEEE Industrial Electronics Magazine (2022- )</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">IEEE Transactions on Industrial Cyber-Physical Systems (2023- )</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">Information Sciences (2012- )</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">Signal Processing (2012- )</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">IET Control Theory and Applications (2012- )</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">Neurocomputing (2012- )</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">Multidimensional Systems and Signal Processing (2012- )</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">Circuits, Systems and Signal Processing (2009- )</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">Conference Editorial Board, IEEE Control Systems Society (2011- )</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">控制理论与应用 <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">(2014- )</span> </span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">自动化学报 <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">(2015- )</span> </span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">控制与决策 <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">(2017- )</span> </span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">系统科学与数学 <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">(2014- )</span> </span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">控制工程 <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">(2017- )</span> </span></p></li>           </ul>           <p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"color:#17365d;\"></span></p>           <hr>           <p style=\"text-align:left;\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(23, 54, 93); font-family:汉仪菱心体简, SimHei;\"><strong style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(192, 0, 0);\">▊</strong> </strong><span style=\"font-size:18px; color:rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span></strong><span style=\"font-family:汉仪菱心体简, SimHei; font-size:18px;\">学术任职</span><br></p>           <ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;\">            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family:方正大黑简体;\">中国侨联特聘专家委员会委员</span><br></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family:方正大黑简体;\">能源化工过程智能制造教育部重点实验室学术委员会委员</span><br></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">黑龙江省复杂系统理论与计算重点实验室学术委员会主任</span><br></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">中国航空教育学会第七届常务理事</span><br></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">中国宇航学会第八届理事</span><br></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">中国宇航学会兼职副秘书长</span><br></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">中国宇航学会空间科学与试验专业委员会常委</span><br></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">中国自动化学会控制理论专业委员会委员</span><br></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\"> 中国自动化学会技术过程故障诊断与安全性专业委员会委员</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">中国自动化学会信息物理系统控制与决策专业委员会委员</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family:方正大黑简体;\">中国仿真学会智能物联系统建模与仿真专业委员会委员</span><br></p></li>            <li><p><span style=\"color:rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family:方正大黑简体;\">中国科学院深圳先进技术研究院客座研究员</span><br></p></li>            <li><p><span style=\"font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">哈尔滨工程大学兼职博士生导师</span></p></li>            <li><p><span style=\"font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">国家科技奖励评审专家</span><br></p></li>            <li><p><span style=\"color:rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family:方正大黑简体;\">美国《数学评论》评论员</span></p></li>           </ul>           <p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:等线; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\"></span></p>           <p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:等线; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\"><strong><strong style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"></strong></strong></span></p>           <hr>           <p style=\"text-align:left;\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(23, 54, 93); font-family:汉仪菱心体简, SimHei;\"><strong style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(192, 0, 0);\">▊</strong> </strong><span style=\"font-size:18px; color:rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span></strong><span style=\"font-family:汉仪菱心体简, SimHei; font-size:18px;\">其他任职</span><br></p>           <ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;\">            <li><p><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">第十四届全国政协委员</span></p></li>            <li><p><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">政协黑龙江省第十三届委员会常务委员</span></p></li>            <li><p><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family:方正大黑简体;\">政协黑龙江省第十二届委员会委员</span></span></p></li>            <li><p><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family:方正大黑简体;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family:方正大黑简体;\">九三学社黑龙江省第九届委员会副主委</span></span></span></p></li>            <li><p><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family:方正大黑简体;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family:方正大黑简体;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family:方正大黑简体;\">九三学社哈尔滨工业大学第五届委员会主委</span></span></span></span></p></li>            <li><p><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family:方正大黑简体;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family:方正大黑简体;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family:方正大黑简体;\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family:方正大黑简体;\">哈尔滨工业大学第一届校务委员会委员</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">哈尔滨工业大学第二届学术委员会委员</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">哈尔滨工业大学第五届人力资源委员会委员</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family:方正大黑简体;\">黑龙江省青联委员</span><br></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">黑龙江省侨联委员</span></p></li>           </ul>          </div>          </div>         </ol>        </dl></li>      </ul>     </div>     <div id=\"tabb876part\" class=\"part_box\" style=\"display: none;\">      <ul class=\"tacherContent_parts\" id=\"tacherContent_parts\" style=\"\">       <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">        <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(87, 122, 149);\">         <div class=\"part_t_l\"> <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em data-editor=\"1\" data-more=\"0\" id=\"999\">主讲课程</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>         </div>         <div class=\"part_r\"> <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>         </div>        </div>        <dl style=\"\">         <ol id=\"ebe7fd5edb2d49e3b642f4867156af21\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">          <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"名称\" data-zh=\"名称\">            名称           </div>           <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>          </div>          <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"5e06710578c74c3d826dd298b67084cd\">           <ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;\">            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">本科生课程：《时滞系统稳定性分析与控制》</span><br></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">本科生课程：《自动化专业导论》</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family:方正大黑简体;\">研究生课程：《时滞系统控制》</span></span></p></li>           </ul>          </div>          </div>         </ol>        </dl></li>       <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">        <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(87, 122, 149);\">         <div class=\"part_t_l\"> <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em data-editor=\"1\" data-more=\"0\" id=\"999\">研究领域</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>         </div>         <div class=\"part_r\"> <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>         </div>        </div>        <dl style=\"\">         <ol id=\"ca29206813114fb599aca633c93dba4e\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">          <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"名称\" data-zh=\"名称\">            名称           </div>           <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>          </div>          <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"4a6dcef0cdbb4fcbbc70f345c00f1910\">           <ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;\">            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">基础理论研究：滑模控制理论及应用、信息物理融合系统、智能系统与控制、非连续动态系统</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">应用基础研究：自主无人集群、无人系统智能感知、智能机器人、电力电子系统控制、飞行器控制</span></p></li>           </ul>          </div>          </div>         </ol>        </dl></li>       <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">        <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(87, 122, 149);\">         <div class=\"part_t_l\"> <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em data-editor=\"1\" data-more=\"0\" id=\"999\">科技奖励</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>         </div>         <div class=\"part_r\"> <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>         </div>        </div>        <dl style=\"\">         <ol id=\"d8a2f00ae85249caa162f5dd3000b231\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">          <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"名称\" data-zh=\"名称\">            名称           </div>           <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>          </div>          <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"060210ea1b8741b2a893085ea01cc4ef\">           <ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;\">            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">具有网络通讯约束的动态系统控制理论与方法，国家自然科学二等奖 (第二完成人，<span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">2014年)</span> </span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">时滞非线性系统基于模糊模型的设计理论与方法，黑龙江省自然科学一等奖 (第一完成人，<span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">2017年)</span> </span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">不确定切换系统的滑模控制理论研究，黑龙江省自然科学一等奖 (第一完成人，<span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">2013年)</span></span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">非线性不确定系统基于状态估计的控制理论与方法，黑龙江省自然科学一等奖 (第五完成人，<span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">2019年)</span></span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">模糊动态系统的控制、状态估计及模型降阶理论与方法，重庆市自然科学一等奖 (第五完成人，<span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">2019年)</span></span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">复杂工业系统的非连续控制与优化研究，中国自动化学会自然科学一等奖 (第五完成人，<span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">2020年)</span></span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">通讯约束下复杂动态系统的分析与控制，中国自动化学会自然科学二等奖 (第二完成人，<span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">2021年)</span></span></p></li>           </ul>          </div>          </div>         </ol>        </dl></li>       <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">        <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(87, 122, 149);\">         <div class=\"part_t_l\"> <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em data-editor=\"1\" data-more=\"0\" id=\"999\">主持项目</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>         </div>         <div class=\"part_r\"> <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>         </div>        </div>        <dl style=\"\">         <ol id=\"2c7b09de82744e4998a005e7c7dece5a\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">          <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"名称\" data-zh=\"名称\">            名称           </div>           <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>          </div>          <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"05e6535c2d0942f7ac5a02c234a17c43\">           <ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;\">            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">非连续控制系统分析与设计，国家杰出青年科学基金 <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">(No.61525303)</span></span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">城市生态空间自主智能清洁平台技术研究及应用示范，国家重点研发计划 <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">(No.2019YFB1312000)</span></span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">智能微电网系统优化运行基础理论及关键技术研究，国家自然科学基金重点国际（地区）合作研究项目 (No.62320106001)</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">信息物理融合系统安全估计与防御控制理论与方法，国家自然科学基金重点项目 <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">(No.62033005)</span></span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">智能无人系统的安全防御控制策略研究，黑龙江省自然科学基金重点项目<span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\"> (No.ZD2021F001)</span></span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">不确定切换系统的滑模控制理论与航天飞行器控制应用，国家级高层次人才计划青年项目 <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">(No.W02070157)</span> </span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">不确定动态系统的滑模控制理论，黑龙江省杰出青年科学基金 <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">(No.JC201406)</span></span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">切换随机混杂系统的分析与综合方法研究，霍英东基金 <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">(No.141059)</span></span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">复杂动态系统的滑模控制理论及应用，国家优秀青年科学基金 <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">(No.61222301)</span></span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">重复过程的模型降阶及其在降阶综合中的应用研究，国家自然科学基金面上项目 <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">(No.61174126)</span></span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">连续/离散重复过程的鲁棒滤波研究，国家自然科学基金青年基金 <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">(No.60804002)</span></span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">网络环境下随机控制系统的分析与综合，教育部新世纪优秀人才支持计划资助 <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">(No.NCET-09-0063)</span></span></p></li>           </ul>          </div>          </div>         </ol>        </dl></li>       <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(87, 122, 149);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon3001\"></i><em id=\"3001\" data-more=\"0\">发表论著</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"d356b7dd3366f4c24eb8f338377171b8\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           名称          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"3218801c62911d61daef6acc481fa3dc\">           <p><br></p>           <p style=\"text-indent:1em;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color:rgb(192, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20220223/1645602458997067982.png\" title=\"1645602458997067982.png\" alt=\"1645602458997067982.png\" width=\"280\" height=\"100\"></span></strong></p>           <p style=\"text-indent:1em;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color:rgb(192, 0, 0);\">※ </span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16px; color:rgb(89, 89, 89);\"><a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8198-5267\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8198-5267</span></a></span></p>           <p style=\"text-indent:1em;\"><br></p>           <p style=\"text-indent:1em;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20221119/1668864161958081045.jpg\" title=\"1668864161958081045.jpg\" alt=\"1668864161958081045.jpg\" width=\"222\" height=\"130\"></p>           <p style=\"text-indent:1em;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color:rgb(192, 0, 0);\">※ </span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16px; color:rgb(89, 89, 89);\"><a href=\"https://www.webofscience.com/wos/author/record/645915\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">https://www.webofscience.com/wos/author/record/645915</span></a></span></p>           <hr>           <p style=\"text-align:left;\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(23, 54, 93); font-family:汉仪菱心体简, SimHei;\"><strong style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(192, 0, 0);\">▊</strong> </strong><span style=\"font-size:18px; color:rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span></strong><span style=\"font-family:汉仪菱心体简, SimHei; font-size:18px;\">英文专著</span><br></p>           <ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;\">            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">L. Wu, P. Shi, and X. Su, Sliding Mode Control of Uncertain Parameter-Switching Hybrid Systems, John Wiley &amp; Sons, London, 288 pages, 2014. (ISBN: 978-1-118-86259-9)</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">L. Wu, X. Su, and P. Shi, Fuzzy Control Systems with Time-Delay and Stochastic Perturbation: Analysis and Synthesis, Springer, Berlin, 348 pages, 2015. (ISBN: B978-3-319-11316-6)</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">L. Wu and Z. Wang, Filtering and Control for Classes of Two-Dimensional Systems, Springer, London, 336 pages, 2015. (ISBN:B978-3-319-13697-4)</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">H. Li, L. Wu, H. K. Lam, and Y. Gao, Analysis and Synthesis for Interval Type-2 Fuzzy-Model-Based Systems, Springer, Singapore, 257 pages, 2016. (ISBN: 978-981-10-0592-3)</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">X. Yao, L. Wu, and W. X. Zheng, Filtering and Control of Stochastic Jump Hybrid Systems, Springer, London, 209 pages, 2016. (ISBN:B978-3-319-31914-8)</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">F. Li, P. Shi, and L. Wu, Control and Filtering for Semi-Markovian Jump Systems, Springer, London, 221 pages, 2016. (ISBN: 978-3-319-47198-3)</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family:Helvetica;\">C. Wu, W. Yao, G. Sun, and L. Wu, Security of Cyber-Physical Systems: State Estimation and Control, Springer, Switzerland, 277 pages, 2022. (ISBN: 978-3-030-88349-2)</span></p></li>           </ul>           <p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:16px; color:rgb(23, 54, 93);\"></span></p>           <hr>           <p style=\"text-align:left; word-break:normal;\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(23, 54, 93); font-family:汉仪菱心体简, SimHei;\"><strong style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(192, 0, 0);\">▊</strong> </strong><span style=\"font-size:18px; color:rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span></strong><span style=\"font-family:汉仪菱心体简, SimHei; font-size:18px;\">代表性论文</span><br></p>           <ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;\">            <li><p style=\"word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">L. Wu, P. Shi*, H. Gao, and C. Wang, H_infinity filtering for 2D Markovian jump systems, Automatica, vol. 44, no. 7, pp. 1849–1858, 2008.</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">L. Wu* and W. X. Zheng, Weighted H_infinity model reduction for linear switched systems with time-varying delay, Automatica, vol. 45, no. 1, pp. 186–193, 2009.</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">L. Wu* and W. X. Zheng, Passivity-based sliding mode control of uncertain singular time-delay systems, Automatica, vol. 45, no. 9, pp. 2120–2127, 2009.</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">L. Wu* and D. W.C. Ho, Sliding mode control of singular stochastic hybrid systems, Automatica, vol. 46, no. 4, pp. 779–783, 2010.</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">L. Wu*, X. Yao, and W. X. Zheng, Generalized H_2 fault detection for Markovian jumping two-dimensional systems, Automatica, vol. 48, no. 8, pp. 1741–1750, 2012.</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">L. Wu*, X. Su, and P. Shi, Sliding mode control with bounded L_2 gain performance of Markovian jump singular time-delay systems, Automatica, vol. 48, no. 8, pp. 1929–1933, 2012.</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">X. Su, L. Wu*, P. Shi, and Y.-D. Song, A novel approach to output feedback control of fuzzy stochastic systems, Automatica, vol. 50, no. 12, pp. 3268–3275, 2014.</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">L. Wu*, R. Yang, P. Shi, and X. Su, Stability analysis and stabilization of 2-D switched systems under arbitrary and restricted switchings, Automatica, vol. 59, no. 1, pp. 206–215, 2015. (Regular paper)</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">F. Li, L. Wu*, P. Shi, and C.-C. Lim, State estimation and sliding mode control of semi-Markovian jump systems with mismatched uncertainties, Automatica, vol. 51, no. 1, pp. 385–393, 2015.</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">L. Wu*, Y. Gao, J. Liu, and H. Li, Event-triggered sliding mode control of stochastic systems via output feedback, Automatica, vol. 82, pp. 79–92, 2017. (Regular paper)</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">G. Sun, L. Wu*, Z. Kuang, Z. Ma, and J. Liu, Practical tracking control of linear motor via fractional-order sliding mode, Automatica, vol. 94, pp. 221–235, 2018. (Regular paper)</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">J. Liu, L. Wu*, C. Wu, W. Luo, and L. G. Franquelo, Event-triggering dissipative control of switched stochastic systems via sliding mode, Automatica, vol. 103, 261–273, 2019. (Regular paper)</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">F. Li, C. Du, C. Yang*, L. Wu, and W. Gui, Finite time asynchronous sliding mode control for Markovian jump systems via average dwell-time, Automatica, vol. 109, 108503, 2019. (Regular paper)</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">Y. Gao, G. Sun, J. Liu, Y. Shi, and L. Wu*, State estimation and self-triggered control of CPSs against joint sensor and actuator attacks, Automatica, vol. 113, 108687, 2020.</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">L. Wu*, P. Shi, and H. Gao, State estimation and sliding-mode control of Markovian jump singular systems, IEEE Transactions on Automatic Control, vol. 55, no. 5, pp. 1213–1219, 2010.</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">L. Wu*, W. X. Zheng, and H. Gao, Dissipativity-based sliding mode control of switched stochastic systems, IEEE Transactions on Automatic Control, vol. 58, no. 3, pp. 785–791, 2013.</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">L. Wu*, X. Su, and P. Shi, Output feedback control of Markovian jump repeated scalar nonlinear systems, IEEE Transactions on Automatic Control, vol. 59, no. 1, pp. 199–204, 2014.</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">X. Su*, P. Shi, L. Wu, and Y. D. Song, Fault detection filtering for nonlinear switched stochastic systems, IEEE Transactions on Automatic Control, vol. 61, no. 5, pp. 1310–1315, 2016.</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">C. Wu, L. Wu*, J. Liu, and Z.-P. Jiang, Active defense control of cyber-physical systems under denial-of-service attacks via sliding mode, IEEE Transactions on Information Forensics and Security, vol. 15, no. 1, pp. 237–249, 2019. (Regular paper)</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">L. Wu* and D. W.C. Ho, Fuzzy filter design for Ito stochastic systems with application to sensor fault detection, IEEE Transactions on Fuzzy Systems, vol. 17, no. 1, pp. 233–242, 2009.</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">L. Wu*, X. Su, P. Shi, and J. Qiu, Model approximation for discrete-time state-delay systems in the T-S fuzzy framework, IEEE Transactions on Fuzzy Systems, vol. 19, no. 2, pp. 366–378, 2011.</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">L. Wu*, X. Yang, and H. K. Lam, Dissipativity analysis and synthesis for discrete-time T-S fuzzy stochastic systems with time-varying delay, IEEE Transactions on Fuzzy Systems, vol. 22, no. 2, pp. 380–394, 2014.</span></p></li>           </ul>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>     </ul>     </div>     <div id=\"tab7c82a4329509956932097980e1b17fd7part\" class=\"part_box\" style=\"display: none;\">      <ul class=\"tacherContent_parts\" id=\"tacherContent_parts\" style=\"\">       <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">        <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(87, 122, 149);\">         <div class=\"part_t_l\"> <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em data-editor=\"1\" data-more=\"0\" id=\"999\">实验室简介</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>         </div>         <div class=\"part_r\"> <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>         </div>        </div>        <dl style=\"\">         <ol id=\"5e027e4758164d6aa228fce16d93de0c\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">          <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"名称\" data-zh=\"名称\">            名称           </div>           <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>          </div>          <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"ab29c8eecefb4b26bb25779a85f94875\">           <p style=\"text-align:center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20200913/1599976021179019436.png\" title=\"1599976021179019436.png\" alt=\"1599976021179019436.png\" width=\"250\" height=\"158\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20200913/1599999374482082013.png\" title=\"1599999374482082013.png\" alt=\"1599999374482082013.png\" width=\"40\" height=\"105\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20210127/1611725896120032840.png\" title=\"1611725896120032840.png\" alt=\"1611725896120032840.png\" width=\"450\" height=\"73\"></p>           <p><br></p>           <p style=\"text-align:justify; text-indent:2em; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">自主智能无人系统工信部重点实验室于2019年获批成立，实验室依托于哈尔滨工业大学控制科学与工程学科，是一个多学科交叉融合协同发展的人才培养和科技创新平台。实验室现有教师和科研人员60余人，其中正高职40人、副高职17人。队伍中有两院院士2人、国家高层次引进人才外国专家2人、国家级高层次人才（特聘教授/领军人才）4人、国家杰出青年基金获得者2人、国家级高层次青年人才4人、国家优秀青年基金获得者5人、IEEE Fellow 4人。另外，实验室聘有兼职教授和博导5人。实验室面向世界科技前沿、面向国家重大需求、面向经济主战场，立足航天、服务国防，聚焦智能控制与系统基础理论、智能无人机技术、智能感知与自动化装备、智能电网等前沿和新兴方向。近年来，实验室共发表学术论文400余篇，获授权发明专利100余项，研究成果获多项国家科技奖和省部级一等奖。实验室与美国、德国、英国、西班牙、澳大利亚、香港等国家和地区建立了长期密切的合作关系。</span></p>           <p style=\"text-align:justify; text-indent:2em; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">吴立刚教授担任重点实验室主任，其领导的团队是实验室的一只重要队伍，团队现有教授<span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">6人、副教授3人、讲师/助理教授4人，包括国家级高层次人才3人、国家级高层次青年人才3人、IEEE Fellow 3人；团队目前在读博士研究生40余名、硕士研究生30余名；团队还聘有兼职教授和兼职博导共5人，包括1名加拿大工程院院士和2名IEEE Fellow。</span></span></p>           <p style=\"text-align:justify; text-indent:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\"><br></span></span></p>           <p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(192, 0, 0);\">★ </span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">重点实验室网站：<span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\"></span><a href=\"http://aius.hit.edu.cn/\" target=\"_blank\">http://aius.hit.edu.cn/</a></span></p>          </div>          </div>         </ol>        </dl></li>      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(87, 122, 149);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon3001\"></i><em id=\"3001\" data-more=\"0\">招生信息</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"eece69e3bb3aac5ceb81fa5fc313e0f3\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           名称          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"22ac04743ff050f651af9f9912416c74\">           <ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;\">            <li><p style=\"\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">哈尔滨工业大学招生计划</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">：每年招收<span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">3-4名硕士研究生、2-3名博士研究生 (欢迎控制科学与工程、机械工程学科的学生报考)</span> </span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">哈尔滨工程大学招生计划</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">：每年招收<span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">1名博士研究生 (兼职博士生导师)</span> </span></p><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">URL:</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\"> <a href=\"http://homepage.hrbeu.edu.cn/web/wuligang1\" target=\"_blank\">http://homepage.hrbeu.edu.cn/web/wuligang1</a></span></p></li>           </ul>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(87, 122, 149);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon3001\"></i><em id=\"3001\" data-more=\"0\">招聘信息</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"540f41c6fb9f0c8751e1a01a477a37d8\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           名称          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"f63dc112fdc959c6d7856c18835b7347\">           <ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;\">            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:方正大黑简体; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">自主智能无人系统工信部重点实验室，现面向海内外招聘师资和研究人员，设有助理教授、神舟学者、神舟青年学者、青年拔尖副教授/教授、国家级青年人才项目等岗位，欢迎申请。</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\"> 详情请见：<a href=\"http://aius.hit.edu.cn/12928/list.htm\" target=\"_blank\">http://aius.hit.edu.cn/12928/list.htm</a></span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">联系邮件：ligangwu@hit.edu.cn</span></p></li>           </ul>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>      </ul>     </div>     <div id=\"tabb3236part\" class=\"part_box\" style=\"display: none;\">      <ul class=\"tacherContent_parts\" id=\"tacherContent_parts\" style=\"\">       <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">        <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(87, 122, 149);\">         <div class=\"part_t_l\"> <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em data-editor=\"1\" data-more=\"0\" id=\"999\">A Brief Introduction</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>         </div>         <div class=\"part_r\"> <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>         </div>        </div>        <dl style=\"\">         <ol id=\"c287df4bb7984b5591bec1b99e73f2d7\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">          <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"名称\" data-zh=\"名称\">            名称           </div>           <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>          </div>          <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"c78c3a0ff07c4b26833a12346eeb0fbe\">           <p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family:Helvetica;\">Ligang Wu</strong><span style=\"color:rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family:Helvetica;\"> (M'10–SM'12–F'20) received the B.S. degree in Automation from Harbin University of Science and Technology, China in 2001; the M.E. degree in Navigation Guidance and Control from Harbin Institute of Technology, China in 2003; the PhD degree in Control Theory and Control Engineering from Harbin Institute of Technology, China in 2006. He was a Research Associate in the Department of Mechanical Engineering, The University of Hong Kong, a Senior Research Associate in the Department of Mathematics, City University of Hong Kong, and a Research Associate in the Department of Electrical and Electronic Engineering, Imperial College London. He joined the Harbin Institute of Technology in 2008, and now he is a Full professor and the Dean of the School of Astronautics of Harbin Institute of Technology. </span><br></p>           <p style=\"text-align: justify; word-break: normal;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family:Helvetica;\"> Prof. Wu is a Fellow of the IEEE (for contributions to sliding mode control and robust filtering) and a Fellow of CAA (Chinese Association of Automation), and the Highly Cited Researcher (since 2015). He was the winner of the National Science Fund for Distinguished Young Scholars in 2015, and was named as the National High-Level Talents (Distinguished Professor) in 2017. He received the China Youth Wusi Medal in 2016. </span>He serves/served as an Associate Editor for a number of journals, including IEEE Transactions on Automatic Control, IEEE Transactions on Industrial Electronics, IEEE/ASME Transactions on Mechatronics, and IEEE Industrial Electronics Magazine. He has published 8 research monographs and more than 200 research papers in international referred journals. His current research interests include analysis and design for complex dynamical systems, autonomous intelligent unmanned systems, intelligent systems and robot technology, machine vision and intelligent detection technology, and power electronic systems. <br></p>          </div>          </div>         </ol>        </dl></li>       <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">        <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(87, 122, 149);\">         <div class=\"part_t_l\"> <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em data-editor=\"1\" data-more=\"0\" id=\"999\">Academic Degrees</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>         </div>         <div class=\"part_r\"> <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>         </div>        </div>        <dl style=\"\">         <ol id=\"0ef167e8e9f2411d968d55e9cdc99ba0\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">          <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"名称\" data-zh=\"名称\">            名称           </div>           <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>          </div>          <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"b13d687616be4651868ad58d640b25ff\">           <ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\">            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(63, 63, 63);\">Doctor of Engineering, Dec.2006, Harbin Institute of Technology, Harbin, P.R. China</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(63, 63, 63);\">Master of Science, Jul. 2003, Harbin Institute of Technology, Harbin, P.R. China</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(63, 63, 63);\">Bachelor of Science, Jul. 2001, Harbin University of Science and Technology, Harbin, P.R. China</span></p></li>           </ul>          </div>          </div>         </ol>        </dl></li>       <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">        <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(87, 122, 149);\">         <div class=\"part_t_l\"> <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em data-editor=\"1\" data-more=\"0\" id=\"999\">Professional Experience</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>         </div>         <div class=\"part_r\"> <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>         </div>        </div>        <dl style=\"\">         <ol id=\"e43fb32923894ed7b3cb08495391bd70\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">          <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"名称\" data-zh=\"名称\">            名称           </div>           <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>          </div>          <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"cc2392ccc6d1421c8376ccde67298468\">           <ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\">            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(63, 63, 63);\">May. 2022-Present: Dean</span></p><p style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(63, 63, 63);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica;\">School of Astronautics, Harbin Institute of Technology, Harbin, P.R. China</span> </span> <br> </p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(63, 63, 63);\">Dec. 2012-Present: Professor</span></p><p style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(63, 63, 63);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica;\">Department of Control Science and Engineering</span> </span> </p><p style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(63, 63, 63);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica;\">School of Astronautics, Harbin Institute of Technology, Harbin, P.R. China</span> </span> </p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(63, 63, 63);\">Dec. 2012-Nov. 2013: Research Associate </span></p><p style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(63, 63, 63);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica;\">Department of Electrical and Electronic Engineering</span> </span> </p><p style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(63, 63, 63);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica;\">Imperial College London, London, United Kingdom</span> </span> </p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(63, 63, 63);\">April 2008-Dec. 2012: Associate Professor</span></p><p style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(63, 63, 63);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica;\">Department of Control Science and Engineering</span> </span> </p><p style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(63, 63, 63);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica;\">School of Astronautics, Harbin Institute of Technology, Harbin, P.R. China</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(63, 63, 63);\"> </span> </p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(63, 63, 63);\">Jan. 2009-May 2009: Senior Research Associate</span></p><p style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(63, 63, 63);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica;\">Department of Mathematics</span> </span> </p><p style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(63, 63, 63);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica;\">City University of Hong Kong, Hong Kong</span> </span> </p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(63, 63, 63);\">April 2007-May 2009: Postdoctoral Fellow</span></p><p style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(63, 63, 63);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica;\">College of Automation Science and Engineering</span> </span> </p><p style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(63, 63, 63);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica;\">South China University of Technology, Guangzhou, P.R. China</span> </span> </p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(63, 63, 63);\">Sept. 2007-Jun. 2008: Senior Research Associate</span></p><p style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(63, 63, 63);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica;\">Department of Mathematics</span> </span> </p><p style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(63, 63, 63);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica;\">City University of Hong Kong, Hong Kong</span> </span> </p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(63, 63, 63);\">Jan. 200