     <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">IEEE/ASME Transaction on Mechachronics (2015- )</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">IEEE Transactions on Industrial Electronics (2019- )</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">IEEE Industrial Electronics Magazine (2022- )</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">IEEE Transactions on Industrial Cyber-Physical Systems (2023- )</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family:Helvetica;\">Information Sciences (2012- )</span><br></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">Signal Processing (2012- )</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">IET Control Theory and Applications (2012- )</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">Neurocomputing (2012- )</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">Multidimensional Systems and Signal Processing (2012- )</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">Circuits, Systems and Signal Processing (2009- )</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">Conference Editorial Board, IEEE Control Systems Society (2011- )</span></p></li>           </ul>           <p><span style=\"font-size:16px; color:rgb(23, 54, 93);\"></span></p>           <hr>           <p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:16px; color:rgb(192, 0, 0);\">〓</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\"> Serves as a Guest Editor to organize special issues, such as <br></span></p>           <ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;\">            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">IEEE Transactions on Industrial Electronics (2016)</span></p><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">Special Issue on Sliding Mode Control and Observation for Complex Industrial Systems</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">International Journal of Fuzzy Systems (2015)</span></p><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">Special Issue on Fuzzy Control Systems: Analysis, Design and Applications</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">Mathematical Problems in Engineering (2014, 2015)</span></p><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">Special Issue on New Developments in Sliding Mode Control and Its Applications</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">Mathematical Problems in Engineering (2013, 2015)</span></p><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">Special Issue on New Developments in Time-Delay Systems and Its Applications in Engineering</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">Proceedings of the IMechE, Part I: Journal of Systems and Control Engineering (2013)</span></p><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">Special Issue on Advanced Control of Aerospace Vehicles</span></p></li>           </ul>          </div>          </div>         </ol>        </dl></li>       <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">        <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(87, 122, 149);\">         <div class=\"part_t_l\"> <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em data-editor=\"1\" data-more=\"0\" id=\"999\">Selected Publications</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>         </div>         <div class=\"part_r\"> <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>         </div>        </div>        <dl style=\"\">         <ol id=\"06435e332daa45938fc87569056162f5\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">          <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"名称\" data-zh=\"名称\">            名称           </div>           <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>          </div>          <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"e1a1ee43cc844f94a301f08247c138fd\">           <p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">Research Achievements </span></p>           <p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">I have published 9 research monographs, 2 book chapters, and over 260 journal and 50 conference papers in the areas of systems and control theory, computational and intelligent systems (automation and control systems design, signal processing, fault detection, intelligent and systems science), and industrial applications (aircraft control, power electronics and drives). My published work, as its novelty, creativity and significance, has been internationally recognized, highly regarded and widely referred (received well over 20000 Google Scholar citations with H-index 74, and over 17000 ISI citation with H-index 68). Among his publications, over 40 journal papers are Highly Cited Papers, according to the Essential Science Indicators reports. In addition, 5 journal papers were awarded the \"Most Cited Article\" by Automatica, and 5 journal papers were named as the Most Influential 100 Academic Papers in China Published in International journals.</span></p>           <p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:16px; color:rgb(23, 54, 93);\"></span></p>           <p style=\"text-indent:2em;\"><a href=\"https://scholar.google.com.hk/citations?user=2mHyb9gAAAAJ&amp;hl=zh-CN\" target=\"_blank\"></a></p>           <hr>           <p style=\"text-indent:2em;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color:rgb(192, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20220223/1645602458997067982.png\" title=\"1645602458997067982.png\" alt=\"1645602458997067982.png\" width=\"280\" height=\"100\"></span></strong></p>           <p style=\"text-indent:2em;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color:rgb(192, 0, 0);\">※ </span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16px; color:rgb(89, 89, 89);\"><a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8198-5267\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8198-5267</span></a></span></p>           <p style=\"text-indent:2em;\"><br></p>           <p style=\"text-indent:2em;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20221119/1668864433288095004.jpg\" title=\"1668864433288095004.jpg\" alt=\"1668864433288095004.jpg\" width=\"222\" height=\"130\"></p>           <p style=\"text-indent:2em;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color:rgb(192, 0, 0);\">※ </span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16px; color:rgb(89, 89, 89);\"><a href=\"https://www.webofscience.com/wos/author/record/645915\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">https://www.webofscience.com/wos/author/record/645915</span></a></span></p>           <hr>           <p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(192, 0, 0); font-family:Helvetica; text-align:center;\">█</span> Research Monographs</span></p>           <ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;\">            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">L. Wu, P. Shi, and X. Su, Sliding Mode Control of Uncertain Parameter-Switching Hybrid Systems, John Wiley &amp; Sons, London, 288 pages, 2014. (ISBN: 978-1-118-86259-9)</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">L. Wu, X. Su, and P. Shi, Fuzzy Control Systems with Time-Delay and Stochastic Perturbation: Analysis and Synthesis, Springer, Berlin, 348 pages, 2015. (ISBN: B978-3-319-11316-6)</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">L. Wu and Z. Wang, Filtering and Control for Classes of Two-Dimensional Systems, Springer, London, 336 pages, 2015. (ISBN:B978-3-319-13697-4)</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">H. Li, L. Wu, H. K. Lam, and Y. Gao, Analysis and Synthesis for Interval Type-2 Fuzzy-Model-Based Systems, Springer, Singapore, 257 pages, 2016. (ISBN: 978-981-10-0592-3)</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">X. Yao, L. Wu, and W. X. Zheng, Filtering and Control of Stochastic Jump Hybrid Systems, Springer, London, 209 pages, 2016. (ISBN: B978-3-319-31914-8)</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">F. Li, P. Shi, and L. Wu, Control and Filtering for Semi-Markovian Jump Systems, Springer, London, 221 pages, 2016. (ISBN: 978-3-319-47198-3)</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family:Helvetica;\">C. Wu, W. Yao, G. Sun, and L. Wu, Security of Cyber-Physical Systems: State Estimation and Control, Springer, Switzerland, 277 pages, 2022. (ISBN: 978-3-030-88349-2)</span><br></p></li>           </ul>           <p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:16px; color:rgb(23, 54, 93);\"></span></p>           <hr>           <p style=\"text-align:center; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(192, 0, 0); font-family:Helvetica; text-align:center;\">█</span> Selected Journal Papers</span></p>           <ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;\">            <li><p style=\"word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">L. Wu, P. Shi*, H. Gao, and C. Wang, H_infinity filtering for 2D Markovian jump systems, Automatica, vol. 44, no. 7, pp. 1849–1858, 2008.</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">L. Wu* and W. X. Zheng, Weighted H_infinity model reduction for linear switched systems with time-varying delay, Automatica, vol. 45, no. 1, pp. 186–193, 2009.</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">L. Wu* and W. X. Zheng, Passivity-based sliding mode control of uncertain singular time-delay systems, Automatica, vol. 45, no. 9, pp. 2120–2127, 2009.</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">L. Wu* and D. W.C. Ho, Sliding mode control of singular stochastic hybrid systems, Automatica, vol. 46, no. 4, pp. 779–783, 2010.</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">L. Wu*, X. Yao, and W. X. Zheng, Generalized H_2 fault detection for Markovian jumping two-dimensional systems, Automatica, vol. 48, no. 8, pp. 1741–1750, 2012.</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">L. Wu*, X. Su, and P. Shi, Sliding mode control with bounded L_2 gain performance of Markovian jump singular time-delay systems, Automatica, vol. 48, no. 8, pp. 1929–1933, 2012.</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">X. Su, L. Wu*, P. Shi, and Y.-D. Song, A novel approach to output feedback control of fuzzy stochastic systems, Automatica, vol. 50, no. 12, pp. 3268–3275, 2014.</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">L. Wu*, R. Yang, P. Shi, and X. Su, Stability analysis and stabilization of 2-D switched systems under arbitrary and restricted switchings, Automatica, vol. 59, no. 1, pp. 206–215, 2015. (Regular paper)</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">F. Li, L. Wu*, P. Shi, and C.-C. Lim, State estimation and sliding mode control of semi-Markovian jump systems with mismatched uncertainties, Automatica, vol. 51, no. 1, pp. 385–393, 2015.</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">L. Wu*, Y. Gao, J. Liu, and H. Li, Event-triggered sliding mode control of stochastic systems via output feedback, Automatica, vol. 82, pp. 79–92, 2017. (Regular paper)</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">G. Sun, L. Wu*, Z. Kuang, Z. Ma, and J. Liu, Practical tracking control of linear motor via fractional-order sliding mode, Automatica, vol. 94, pp. 221–235, 2018. (Regular paper)</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">J. Liu, L. Wu*, C. Wu, W. Luo, and L. G. Franquelo, Event-triggering dissipative control of switched stochastic systems via sliding mode, Automatica, vol. 103, 261–273, 2019. (Regular paper)</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">F. Li, C. Du, C. Yang*, L. Wu, and W. Gui, Finite time asynchronous sliding mode control for Markovian jump systems via average dwell-time, Automatica, vol. 109, 108503, 2019. (Regular paper)</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family:Helvetica;\">L. Wu*, P. Shi, and H. Gao, State estimation and sliding-mode control of Markovian jump singular systems, IEEE Transactions on Automatic Control, vol. 55, no. 5, pp. 1213–1219, 2010.</span><br></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">L. Wu*, W. X. Zheng, and H. Gao, Dissipativity-based sliding mode control of switched stochastic systems, IEEE Transactions on Automatic Control, vol. 58, no. 3, pp. 785–791, 2013.</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">L. Wu*, X. Su, and P. Shi, Output feedback control of Markovian jump repeated scalar nonlinear systems, IEEE Transactions on Automatic Control, vol. 59, no. 1, pp. 199–204, 2014.</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family:Helvetica;\">C. Wu, L. Wu*, J. Liu, and Z.-P. Jiang, Active defense control of cyber-physical systems under denial-of-service attacks via sliding mode, IEEE Transactions on Information Forensics and Security, vol. 15, no. 1, pp. 237–249, 2019. (Regular paper)</span><br></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">L. Wu* and D. W.C. Ho, Fuzzy filter design for Ito stochastic systems with application to sensor fault detection, IEEE Transactions on Fuzzy Systems, vol. 17, no. 1, pp. 233–242, 2009.</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">L. Wu*, X. Su, P. Shi, and J. Qiu, Model approximation for discrete-time state-delay systems in the T-S fuzzy framework, IEEE Transactions on Fuzzy Systems, vol. 19, no. 2, pp. 366–378, 2011.</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"text-align:justify; word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">L. Wu*, X. Yang, and H. K. Lam, Dissipativity analysis and synthesis for discrete-time T-S fuzzy stochastic systems with time-varying delay, IEEE Transactions on Fuzzy Systems, vol. 22, no. 2, pp. 380–394, 2014.</span></p></li>           </ul>          </div>          </div>         </ol>        </dl></li>       <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">        <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(87, 122, 149);\">         <div class=\"part_t_l\"> <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em data-editor=\"1\" data-more=\"0\" id=\"999\">Selected Research Grants</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>         </div>         <div class=\"part_r\"> <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>         </div>        </div>        <dl style=\"\">         <ol id=\"82627a028ca84d2eb3e7a13e4b90ffd4\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">          <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"名称\" data-zh=\"名称\">            名称           </div>           <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>          </div>          <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"fcc7950e135545fdaddd0e2f8b2308a7\">           <ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;\">            <li><p style=\"word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">Secure Estimation and Defense Control Theories and Methodologies for Cyber-Physical Systems (No. 62033005)</span><br></p><p style=\"word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">Principal Investigator: Ligang Wu</span> </p><p style=\"word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">National Natural Science Foundation of China (Key Program)</span> </p><p style=\"word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">2021.01–2024.12</span> </p><p style=\"word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">￥2,910,000</span> </p></li>            <li><p style=\"word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">Technologies and Applications of Autonomous Intelligent Cleaning Platform for Urban Ecological Space (No. 2019YFB1312000)</span><br></p><p style=\"word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">Principal Investigator: Ligang Wu</span> </p><p style=\"word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">National Key Research and Development Program of China</span><br> </p><p style=\"word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">2019.10–2022.09</span><br> </p><p style=\"word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">￥48,110,000</span> </p></li>            <li><p style=\"word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">Analysis and Design for Discontinuous Control Systems (No. 61525303)</span></p><p style=\"word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">Principal Investigator: Ligang Wu</span> </p><p style=\"word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">National Science Fund for Distinguished Young Scholars, NSFC</span><br> </p><p style=\"word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">2016.01–2020.12</span><br> </p><p style=\"word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">￥4,000,000</span> </p></li>            <li><p style=\"word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">Sliding Mode Control Theory for Uncertain Switched Systems and Its Application to Aerospace Control (No. W02070157)</span></p><p style=\"word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">Principal Investigator: Ligang Wu</span> </p><p style=\"word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">The Youth Top-notch Talent Support Program of the Central Organization Department</span><br> </p><p style=\"word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">2015.01–2017.12</span> </p><p style=\"word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica; color:rgb(38, 38, 38);\">￥2,100,000</span> </p></li>            <li><p style=\"word-break:normal;\"><span style=\"font